WEBVTT

00:04:28.764 --> 00:04:31.851
as well as urban heat environments.

00:04:31.892 --> 00:04:34.895
A few trees and no open space.

00:04:34.937 --> 00:04:40.359
So today we're still living out
the legacy of those racist policies.

00:04:41.068 --> 00:04:44.530
Now, I first began organizing
around these issues

00:04:44.572 --> 00:04:49.452
