in my West Harlem neighborhood.

00:04:49.493 --> 00:04:54.206
In 1988, I co-founded West Harlem
Environmental Action,

00:04:54.248 --> 00:04:57.043
known as WE ACT for Environmental Justice.

00:04:57.084 --> 00:04:59.420
